/1912410/extras/017d102ee7be9217b161124acfa41f17.webm?t=1790668865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912410/extras/017d102ee7be9217b161124acfa41f17.mp4?t=1790668865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an all-new chapter in the Minecraft Dungeons saga that takes you across the Overworld... and beyond </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912410/extras/a0a34b6a49eaa9dd47973c4d33cfd5e0.poster.avif?t=1790668865\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912410/extras/a0a34b6a49eaa9dd47973c4d33cfd5e0.webm?t=1790668865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912410/extras/a0a34b6a49eaa9dd47973c4d33cfd5e0.mp4?t=1790668865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft the perfect hero with legendary gear, including a wide range of weapons, armour, and artifacts </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912410/extras/41a096243379856c26d49e3920687c20.poster.avif?t=1790668865\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912410/extras/41a096243379856c26d49e3920687c20.webm?t=1790668865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1912410/extras/41a096243379856c26d49e3920687c20.mp4?t=1790668865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with new and old friends in a party of up 